### confirm email token
POST {{protocol}}{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/auth/email-confirmations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "a32f1eaa-7b1a-4015-9b27-bf8d6e0bcaf0" }


### reset password
POST {{protocol}}{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/auth/password-reset-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kirk.lazarus@gmail.com" }


### save new password
